WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.980
<b>Nurse's Office</b>

00:00:06.110 --> 00:00:07.310
<b>Year 1\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\hYear 2</b>

00:00:06.110 --> 00:00:07.310
<b>Health Report\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\hKoyuki Seri</b>

00:00:07.310 --> 00:00:08.640
<i>This is great!</i>

00:00:08.640 --> 00:00:10.280
<i>I've gotten taller since last year!</i>

00:00:10.810 --> 00:00:14.180
<i>Now I probably don't need to worry about 
Sumiso-san being taller than me, right?</i>

00:00:14.180 --> 00:00:16.850
<i>She's about 155 centimeters 
tall, so probably...</i>

00:00:16.850 --> 00:00:19.750
I'm glad you're so calm, Seri-kun.

00:00:19.980 --> 00:00:24.460
There's a rumor going around that 
Sumiso-san's dating a tall first-year.

00:00:26.800 --> 00:00:28.200
Gestöber!

00:00:28.200 --> 00:00:29.090
Koyukichi-dono!

00:00:29.860 --> 00:00:30.840
<i>It can't be...</i>

00:00:30.840 --> 00:00:32.750
Sumiso-san, why?

00:00:32.750 --> 00:00:33.680
Who is that?

00:00:33.680 --> 00:00:37.290
A tall, handsome, manly, dependable guy...

00:00:37.290 --> 00:00:40.620
The complete opposite of you, huh?

00:00:41.280 --> 00:00:42.320
Why?

00:00:42.640 --> 00:00:43.980
Sumiso-san...

00:00:43.980 --> 00:00:46.540
It can't be... No!

00:00:47.810 --> 00:00:49.280
Gestöber!

00:00:49.280 --> 00:00:52.160
No!

00:00:50.210 --> 00:00:52.160
Seri-kun, this locker is open!

00:00:52.520 --> 00:00:53.740
A locker!

00:00:54.700 --> 00:00:55.880
Gestöber!

00:00:55.880 --> 00:00:56.670
Koyukichi-dono!

00:00:56.670 --> 00:00:57.850
Gestöber-senpai!

00:00:59.290 --> 00:01:01.960
<i>I'm so glad this locker was here.</i>

00:01:13.260 --> 00:01:21.310
<b>A Destructive God Sits Next to Me</b>

00:02:32.420 --> 00:02:36.300
<b><i>Delusion 11</i></b>

00:02:32.700 --> 00:02:34.780
Feeling better, Seri-kun?

00:02:41.230 --> 00:02:42.690
Oh, it was just a dream.

00:02:42.690 --> 00:02:44.390
This is totally real, Seri-kun.

00:02:49.530 --> 00:02:53.000
<i>God, how could you do this to me?</i>

00:02:53.000 --> 00:02:56.700
<i>You can't take Sumiso-san from me! 
She's all that keeps me going!</i>

00:02:56.700 --> 00:02:57.770
Don't worry!

00:02:57.770 --> 00:03:00.580
You've got me, Gestöber.

00:03:00.580 --> 00:03:02.490
<i>I'm not talking to you, God of Destruction.</i>

00:03:02.800 --> 00:03:04.960
It's just a rumor.

00:03:04.960 --> 00:03:07.660
Why not ask her about it yourself?

00:03:07.660 --> 00:03:09.600
That's right, Gestöber!

00:03:09.600 --> 00:03:10.780
Koyukichi-dono!

00:03:10.780 --> 00:03:12.880
I'll be with you all the way, 
Gestöber-senpai!

00:03:18.860 --> 00:03:20.220
Koyuki-kun!

00:03:20.220 --> 00:03:25.220
S-Sumiso-san, uh... I mean, um...

00:03:29.280 --> 00:03:30.270
Um...

00:03:33.480 --> 00:03:35.810
K-Koyuki-kun?

00:03:39.020 --> 00:03:41.220
You couldn't ask her, Seri-kun?

00:03:41.220 --> 00:03:44.700
Pretending you don't see anything 
won't change the facts.

00:03:44.370 --> 00:03:48.200
<b>Ha
ha</b>

00:03:44.370 --> 00:03:48.200
<b>Ha
ha</b>

00:03:45.060 --> 00:03:46.660
What's wrong, Gestöber?

00:03:46.660 --> 00:03:48.200
Why are you so depressed?

00:03:48.970 --> 00:03:50.890
Is it that woman?

00:03:49.420 --> 00:03:50.890
Koyuki-kun!

00:03:50.890 --> 00:03:53.370
You're too good for her anyway!

00:03:53.620 --> 00:03:56.410
Fate is a real thing, you know.

00:03:56.410 --> 00:03:58.470
Like the fate that binds you and me!

00:03:58.900 --> 00:04:00.340
Wait, Kabu-dono!

00:04:00.700 --> 00:04:03.890
Koyukichi-dono may be upset 
because he feels inferior.

00:04:04.200 --> 00:04:06.520
Worry not, Koyukichi-dono!

00:04:06.520 --> 00:04:08.700
You're cute and loved.

00:04:08.700 --> 00:04:11.680
Even if you're short or ugly,

00:04:11.680 --> 00:04:13.220
you still have value.

00:04:13.220 --> 00:04:14.530
That's right.

00:04:14.530 --> 00:04:18.080
Hot people only matter 
because ugly people exist.

00:04:18.080 --> 00:04:18.980
It's okay!

00:04:18.980 --> 00:04:21.560
You're allowed to be a shrimp!

00:04:21.990 --> 00:04:23.650
Shoryu!

00:04:25.880 --> 00:04:27.740
Don't worry, Seri-kun.

00:04:27.740 --> 00:04:29.710
You can compensate for
 your height with these boots.

00:04:31.850 --> 00:04:34.740
Why are you sitting with your 
arms around your knees, Koyuki?

00:04:35.670 --> 00:04:37.360
I'm not.

00:04:37.360 --> 00:04:39.880
My legs are just so long, 
there's nowhere else for them to go.

00:04:40.130 --> 00:04:41.090
<b>Ha
ha</b>

00:04:40.130 --> 00:04:41.090
<b>Ha
ha</b>

00:04:44.080 --> 00:04:45.760
<i>I don't want to believe it.</i>

00:04:45.900 --> 00:04:48.130
<i>Sumiso-san can't have a boyf—</i>

00:04:48.840 --> 00:04:50.970
I told you, just ask her!

00:04:51.880 --> 00:04:55.660
<i>Just who was she smiling at like that?</i>

00:04:56.100 --> 00:04:57.260
<i>I hate him!</i>

00:04:57.260 --> 00:04:58.310
<i>I hate everything!</i>

00:04:58.680 --> 00:05:01.400
<i>Why are these guys the 
only ones smiling at me?</i>

00:05:01.400 --> 00:05:04.960
Hey, there was this totally hot guy 
at the station the other day.

00:05:04.960 --> 00:05:06.910
I couldn't believe it!

00:05:06.910 --> 00:05:08.260
He was so hot, I couldn't even...

00:05:08.260 --> 00:05:11.450
Everybody only cares about looks...

00:05:09.180 --> 00:05:11.450
Listen, Seri-kun.

00:05:11.450 --> 00:05:13.820
They don't care about what's inside.

00:05:13.820 --> 00:05:15.310
Just appearances!

00:05:16.460 --> 00:05:17.900
This world is shit.

00:05:19.380 --> 00:05:21.080
Calm down, Seri-kun!

00:05:21.340 --> 00:05:23.800
Sumiso-san never said any of that.

00:05:24.020 --> 00:05:26.540
If you've made up your mind 
without even asking her,

00:05:26.540 --> 00:05:28.930
aren't you the one who doesn't 
care what's inside <i>her</i>?

00:05:28.930 --> 00:05:31.000
<i>H-He's right! I...</i>

00:05:31.000 --> 00:05:32.240
And what's more,

00:05:32.240 --> 00:05:36.480
people who think like that always assume 
it's what's inside that makes them superior.

00:05:37.080 --> 00:05:40.720
But just what makes you so confident 
about what you're like on the inside?

00:05:40.720 --> 00:05:44.200
Oh... I don't mean "you" specifically. 
Lots of people are like that.

00:05:44.200 --> 00:05:47.320
But, I mean, if someone actually 
saw inside you and said,

00:05:47.320 --> 00:05:51.300
"Hey, that's nothing special. 
This hottie I know is way better..."

00:05:51.300 --> 00:05:54.240
Then you'd have nothing left.

00:05:54.240 --> 00:05:58.280
So maybe you're just using 
looks as a convenient excuse.

00:05:58.280 --> 00:06:00.720
Oh, and I don't mean "you" specifically!

00:06:07.000 --> 00:06:09.550
He barfed! Gestöber barfed!

00:06:09.550 --> 00:06:11.480
Gestöber-senpai barfed!

00:06:11.480 --> 00:06:13.160
Don't worry, Koyukichi-dono.

00:06:13.160 --> 00:06:14.930
I like you even if you barf.

00:06:14.930 --> 00:06:17.360
Gestöber, take my tissues!

00:06:19.950 --> 00:06:24.820
So now we're all going to come up with
 a plan to help Seri-kun beat the hot guy.

00:06:25.860 --> 00:06:27.530
Yay!

00:06:27.530 --> 00:06:30.070
<i>Just leave me be.</i>

00:06:30.070 --> 00:06:32.220
So who <i>is</i> the hot guy?

00:06:32.220 --> 00:06:33.780
Supposedly a first-year.

00:06:33.780 --> 00:06:37.240
First, we need to learn more about him.

00:06:37.240 --> 00:06:38.590
Open wide, Hanadori!

00:06:40.160 --> 00:06:44.460
A lot of the time, it just turns 
out to be her little brother.

00:06:45.200 --> 00:06:46.440
Her little brother?!

00:06:49.140 --> 00:06:52.260
If it were her little brother, there 
wouldn't be rumors about them dating!

00:06:52.800 --> 00:06:55.680
Do you hate that guy, Gestöber?

00:06:58.530 --> 00:07:01.160
Understood. Don't worry.

00:07:01.480 --> 00:07:04.220
Your enemies are my enemies!

00:07:04.220 --> 00:07:05.630
I'll do something!

00:07:05.630 --> 00:07:08.840
I'll show him who's the upperclassman here!

00:07:08.840 --> 00:07:10.570
<i>What kind of senpai does that make you?</i>

00:07:10.570 --> 00:07:12.900
So cheer up, Gestöber!

00:07:12.900 --> 00:07:13.740
<i>Enough.</i>

00:07:13.740 --> 00:07:15.220
So then...

00:07:17.800 --> 00:07:19.300
S-Sumiso-san!

00:07:19.300 --> 00:07:20.790
Oh? It's Koyuki-kun and his friends!

00:07:22.380 --> 00:07:23.650
What a coincidence!

00:07:23.650 --> 00:07:24.330
<i>That's him!</i>

00:07:24.330 --> 00:07:26.540
<i>The tall, hot guy!</i>

00:07:26.850 --> 00:07:29.780
Gestöber, you can't handle him! Get back!

00:07:29.780 --> 00:07:32.340
Huh, so you think you're tough, do ya?

00:07:32.340 --> 00:07:36.020
Wh-Who are you supposed to be?

00:07:33.520 --> 00:07:35.280
<i>You're not even looking him in the eye, Senpai!</i>

00:07:35.280 --> 00:07:36.010
<i>Don't push yourself!</i>

00:07:36.300 --> 00:07:38.060
Masaki Hatsuyuki.

00:07:38.480 --> 00:07:40.600
I'm a first-year at Middle School 5.

00:07:40.760 --> 00:07:42.800
O-Oh, yeah? Hmph!

00:07:43.290 --> 00:07:45.280
You heard the man, Gestöber!

00:07:45.280 --> 00:07:47.370
<i>All you did was get his name, Senpai.</i>

00:07:47.370 --> 00:07:49.020
<i>But you tried your best. Thanks.</i>

00:07:49.020 --> 00:07:51.540
So, Koyuki-kun, my friend here is...

00:07:51.540 --> 00:07:52.240
<i>Your friend?!</i>

00:07:52.620 --> 00:07:55.600
Calm down, Seri-kun. Don't overreact.

00:07:55.450 --> 00:07:57.080
<b>Ha\h\hha\h\hha\h\hha\h\hha\h\hha\h\hha</b>

00:07:57.870 --> 00:08:00.290
What?! You're Gorio-senpai's little brother?

00:08:00.330 --> 00:08:03.120
<b>Little

00:08:00.920 --> 00:08:01.920
Yes.

00:08:03.270 --> 00:08:08.470
<i>All they have in common is 
their height and that nasty glare.</i>

00:08:04.120 --> 00:08:08.460
<b>Big Brother</b>

00:08:08.690 --> 00:08:11.050
<i>Genes sure play some scary tricks...</i>

00:08:13.100 --> 00:08:16.550
Gorio and I were enemies
 when he was still alive.

00:08:16.550 --> 00:08:20.030
It must be fate that drew you to me.

00:08:20.030 --> 00:08:21.740
He's still alive.

00:08:22.780 --> 00:08:24.710
Listen, after his death...

00:08:24.710 --> 00:08:25.980
He's alive.

00:08:24.720 --> 00:08:29.320
I, Miguel, the dark god of destruction,
took over the school!

00:08:29.320 --> 00:08:31.060
Remember that, Mini-Gorio!

00:08:31.190 --> 00:08:32.520
<i>Mini-Gorio?</i>

00:08:32.520 --> 00:08:36.790
<i>No, what matters right now is 
his relationship with Sumiso-san.</i>

00:08:36.790 --> 00:08:39.620
<i>What's she doing with Gorio's 
brother? I want to know...</i>

00:08:37.840 --> 00:08:39.610
See? They're a lot of fun, right?

00:08:40.120 --> 00:08:44.340
<i>But I'm scared to ask. If she 
tells me they're dating, I'll die.</i>

00:08:40.430 --> 00:08:43.090
It seems you and I must do battle.

00:08:43.090 --> 00:08:48.050
Gestöber and I have been fighting to 
protect Earth across countless lifetimes!

00:08:45.090 --> 00:08:47.000
<i>I don't stand a chance against him.</i>

00:08:48.050 --> 00:08:49.110
<i>But...</i>

00:08:51.140 --> 00:08:55.550
Um, my brother and 
Kotoko-chan told me about you.

00:08:55.550 --> 00:08:58.640
<i>K-K-K-K-K-K-K-Kotoko-chan?!</i>

00:08:58.860 --> 00:09:03.300
You're Miguel, the dark god of 
destruction, a.k.a. Sturmhut-sama,

00:09:03.300 --> 00:09:06.440
and the Hierophant of Ice, Gestöber-sama!

00:09:06.440 --> 00:09:08.100
You're so cool!

00:09:08.100 --> 00:09:09.430
Wha?

00:09:08.150 --> 00:09:09.440
<b>W h a</b>

00:09:09.430 --> 00:09:12.840
I'm... I'm a huge fan!

00:09:12.840 --> 00:09:15.910
Do you think I have a destiny 
from a past life, too?

00:09:16.410 --> 00:09:17.780
D-Do you?

00:09:17.780 --> 00:09:20.280
<i>Huh? What's this guy's deal? Is he for real?</i>

00:09:20.830 --> 00:09:24.650
I do sense a different fate between you 
and me than I did with your brother.

00:09:24.650 --> 00:09:25.860
Could it be...

00:09:25.860 --> 00:09:27.510
What? Really?!

00:09:27.780 --> 00:09:31.420
I-If you want, I can try shaking your hand.

00:09:33.250 --> 00:09:34.820
Thank you!

00:09:34.820 --> 00:09:37.200
What an honor! I can't believe it!

00:09:37.200 --> 00:09:38.050
<i>I can't, either...</i>

00:09:38.050 --> 00:09:40.920
Hey, this is no cause for celebration!

00:09:40.920 --> 00:09:42.640
War is a very serious thing!

00:09:42.640 --> 00:09:44.180
Of course! I'll follow you anywhere!

00:09:44.180 --> 00:09:46.400
<i>Forget about that! What about Sumiso-san?</i>

00:09:47.180 --> 00:09:50.240
Next time we meet, I'll remember 
your name from your old life!

00:09:50.240 --> 00:09:54.660
Mini-Gorio, I'm sure you 
were my biggest supporter!

00:09:55.400 --> 00:09:59.450
<b>Yank</b>

