00:09:58.280 --> 00:09:59.640
Sturmhut-sama!

00:09:59.640 --> 00:10:02.850
W-Wait, Gestöber! Don't get the wrong idea!

00:10:02.850 --> 00:10:05.040
I didn't choose him because he's hot!

00:10:05.040 --> 00:10:06.180
It's what's inside that—

00:10:06.180 --> 00:10:08.810
What's inside, my ass!

00:10:08.810 --> 00:10:10.360
Don't give me that shit!

00:10:10.360 --> 00:10:13.800
If you betray me, 
I'll literally have no one left!

00:10:12.920 --> 00:10:14.500
Koyuki-kun, calm down!

00:10:14.500 --> 00:10:19.000
Seri-kun, since when have you considered 
Hanadori a core part of your identity?

00:10:19.000 --> 00:10:21.530
Miguel-senpai, wasn't I 
your number one student?

00:10:21.530 --> 00:10:24.570
You, beep-boop boy.
 Calm Kabu-dono down at once.

00:10:26.800 --> 00:10:31.740
Actually, I've been friends with the 
Masaki brothers since we were little.

00:10:31.930 --> 00:10:34.890
I'm sorry for telling him about you.

00:10:34.890 --> 00:10:39.210
I was just so happy to have someone 
besides me who's rooting for you two.

00:10:39.770 --> 00:10:42.230
He's not my b-boyfriend or anything.

00:10:43.670 --> 00:10:45.160
<i>Oh, thank God!</i>

00:10:45.160 --> 00:10:47.500
That's why I told you to ask.

00:10:47.500 --> 00:10:53.250
But your obsession with Hanadori means 
what's inside <i>you</i> is totally worthless.

00:10:53.250 --> 00:10:54.210
Shaddup!

00:10:55.000 --> 00:10:57.420
Gestöber's in love with me.

00:10:57.420 --> 00:10:59.340
You two are so amazing!

00:10:59.340 --> 00:11:01.950
I can't wait for you to remember 
my name from my last life!

00:10:59.340 --> 00:11:06.970
<b>Hahahahahahahahahahahahahahahahahaha</b>

00:11:01.950 --> 00:11:03.930
I'm beginning to recall a distant memory!

00:11:03.930 --> 00:11:04.510
Really?!

