00:20:45.550 --> 00:20:52.810
RIP
Koyuki

00:20:45.550 --> 00:20:52.810
RIP
Koyuki

00:20:46.620 --> 00:20:52.810
RIP
Koyuki

00:20:47.110 --> 00:20:50.430
I hope your school life here 
pays off for you, Seri-kun.

00:20:47.410 --> 00:20:52.810
RIP
Koyuki

00:20:47.870 --> 00:20:52.810
RIP
Koyuki

00:20:48.120 --> 00:20:52.810
RIP
Koyuki

00:20:48.280 --> 00:20:52.810
RIP
Koyuki

00:20:48.450 --> 00:20:52.810
RIP
Koyuki

00:20:50.920 --> 00:20:52.820
Go home already!

00:20:53.060 --> 00:20:55.990
<i>Wait, they were talking about 
people who could beat</i>

00:20:55.990 --> 00:20:59.980
<i>the stupidity out of them, and who 
they could share their ideas with...</i>

00:20:59.980 --> 00:21:01.020
<i>Don't tell me...</i>

00:21:01.460 --> 00:21:02.820
<i>No, that's impossible.</i>

00:21:03.570 --> 00:21:06.830
<i>And so my darkness grew deeper...</i>

00:21:07.290 --> 00:21:10.950
As fellow beings of darkness, 
let's be friends...

00:21:11.180 --> 00:21:12.930
"Gestöber."

00:21:12.930 --> 00:21:14.540
I'm not one of you.

00:21:14.540 --> 00:21:15.860
Stop following me!

00:21:15.860 --> 00:21:17.940
Hello, is this the police?

00:22:49.260 --> 00:22:51.720
<b>What was your name that I heard when I was young?</b>

00:22:52.120 --> 00:22:54.480
Me? Koyuki Seri-kun.

00:22:54.470 --> 00:22:56.180
<b>What was your name that I heard when I was young?</b>

00:22:56.930 --> 00:22:59.190
Hanadori Ka...

00:22:59.190 --> 00:23:00.140
<b>Huh?\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\hWhat?</b>

00:23:03.060 --> 00:23:04.770
<b>What was your name that I heard when I was young?</b>

00:23:05.160 --> 00:23:07.600
You're talking to a little kid?

00:23:07.600 --> 00:23:09.280
I called the cops!

00:23:09.280 --> 00:23:11.490
<b>What was your name that I heard when I was young?</b>

00:23:11.570 --> 00:23:23.940
Shikimi

00:23:12.910 --> 00:23:15.350
You dare speak to me?

00:23:15.350 --> 00:23:20.520
I'll crunch you like this cracker!

00:23:20.520 --> 00:23:22.700
Yes. My name is...

00:23:22.700 --> 00:23:24.980
Tokimune Shikimi!

00:23:24.980 --> 00:23:26.070
<b><u>Hanadori</u>
Line</b>

00:23:25.640 --> 00:23:27.100
Congratulations on finishing the project!

00:23:26.110 --> 00:23:26.270
<b><u>Hanadori</u>
Line</b>

00:23:26.780 --> 00:23:27.440
<b><u>Hanadori</u>
Line</b>

00:23:27.100 --> 00:23:29.330
It was like watching your kid's recital!

00:23:27.780 --> 00:23:28.110
<b><u>Hanadori</u>
Line</b>

00:23:28.440 --> 00:23:28.860
<b><u>Koyuki</u>
